OL,5,G1200 Train Truckers
OL,6,     FHeavy Haul Train: A CBD80
OL,7,     Fbattery-powered loco needs to be
OL,8,     Fhauled 20 miles from a factory in
OL,9,     FBurton-on-Trent to the heritage
OL,10,     FChasewater Railway in
OL,11,     FStaffordshire.
OL,12,G1300 Train Truckers
OL,13,     FHigh-Speed Super Train: Kevin and
OL,14,     FKieran move three state-of-the-art
OL,15,     Ftrains, fresh in from Japan. They
OL,16,     Fneed to transport them from the
OL,17,     FNorth East port of Redcar to a
OL,18,     Ffactory in Doncaster.
